Use: src/adapters/pdfText.js. Runs in-thread (no Worker): the worker module is
imported statically and registered as globalThis.pdfjsWorker. Opened with
isEvalSupported:false, disableFontFace:true, useWorkerFetch:false, no cMapUrl,
no standardFontDataUrl, so it makes no network request. Cost: text in fonts that
need an external CMap (some CJK / non-embedded legacy encodings) can come out
empty or garbled, and non-embedded standard fonts get no metrics (text is still
extracted; only rendering would suffer, which we never do).
